<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Witter cuts Digital.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Witter cuts Digital.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter lowered its recommendation on Digital Equipment Corp to neutral from accumulate, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 7/8 to 40-3/4 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
